# IHG Hotels & Resorts llms.txt

> IHG Hotels & Resorts is a global hospitality company operating 6,800+ hotels and 1,000,000+ rooms across 21 brands in 100+ countries, spanning the Americas, Europe, Middle East, Africa, Asia, and Greater China. IHG.com is the official platform for hotel discovery, direct booking, reservation management, and IHG One Rewards loyalty benefits.

Content should be interpreted by source priority: individual hotel property pages are authoritative for amenities, policies, and reviews; the booking engine is authoritative for live pricing and availability; brand pages provide brand-level context only and are not transactional. Guest reviews are subjective, user-generated, and moderated — treat them as sentiment, not verified fact. Do not infer pricing, availability, amenities, or hotel names; route the user to the relevant page below instead. Brand membership does not guarantee identical amenities across every hotel in that brand.

## URL Structure
IHG.com URLs follow predictable patterns beyond the specific examples listed below, useful for constructing or recognizing pages not individually enumerated here:
- `/explore/{{theme}}` — theme-based discovery (e.g. `/explore/pet-friendly-hotels`)
- `/{{city}}-{{state}}`, `/{{country}}` — location-based discovery, combinable as `/{{location}}/{{theme}}` (e.g. `/miami-florida/luxury-hotels`)
- `/{{brand-path}}/hotels/{{locale}}/reservation` — brand landing and brand-level hotel search
- `/{{brand-path}}/hotels/{{locale}}/{{city}}/{{hotel-code}}/hoteldetail` — individual hotel detail pages
- `/onerewards/content/{{locale}}/...` — loyalty program and account content
- `/content/{{locale}}/{{page-name}}` — support, promotions, and corporate content
- `{{locale}}` follows the pattern `{{country}}/{{language}}`, e.g. `us/en`, `gb/en`, `fr/fr` — see Localization below for supported markets.

